  "distanthorizons.config.client.qualityPresetSetting": "品質之預設",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.qualityPresetSetting.@tooltip": "更動甚多圖形設定，以速改 Distant Horizons 渲染之質。\r\n\r\n若 GPU 將滿，或幀率有患，可降此項。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.threadPresetSetting": "CPU 之負",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.threadPresetSetting.@tooltip": "更動 Distant Horizons 所用線程之數。\r\n\r\n增此，則增遠距生成器及 LOD 載入之速，\r\n然亦增 CPU/記憶之耗，或生滯礙。\r\n\r\n注：此乃相對之數，隨 CPU 而設。\r\n雙核與六十四核所受之壓當同。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.optionsButton": "示「設定」按鈕",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.optionsButton.@tooltip": "於 FOV 按鈕之左示 config 按鈕",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced": "進階設定",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics": "圖形",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.worldGenerator": "世界生成",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.server": "伺服器",
