  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiThreading": "多線程",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.logging": "日誌",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality": "品質",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodChunkRenderDistanceRadius": "LOD 區塊渲染距之半徑",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodChunkRenderDistanceRadius.@tooltip": "Distant Horizons 渲染之距，以區塊計。\r\n\r\n注：此乃盡力之數。\r\n所實渲染之距，或盈或虧，\r\n視爾其餘圖形設定而定。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.horizontalQuality": "LOD 衰變之距",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.horizontalQuality.@tooltip": "此示 LOD 品質之衰，諸級相去之遠。\r\n\r\n數愈大，諸衰級相去愈遠，\r\n然記憶與 GPU 之耗亦增。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.maxHorizontalResolution": "水平解析之限",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.maxHorizontalResolution.@tooltip": "LOD 所能渲染之最細。\r\n\r\n§6最疾：§r 區塊\r\n§6最華：§r 方塊",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.verticalQuality": "垂直之質",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.verticalQuality.@tooltip": "LOD 於懸突、洞穴、絕壁之狀，得其幾何之似？\r\n\r\n愈高，記憶與 GPU 之耗愈增。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.useCameraPositionForQualityDropOff": "以鏡之位定衰質",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.useCameraPositionForQualityDropOff.@tooltip": "若為真，DH 定 LOD 之衰質時，以鏡之位計之。\r\n若為偽，則以玩家之位計之。\r\n\r\n啟此，助自由鏡模之正確渲染。\r\n停此，助多鏡模之正確渲染 (如 Immersive Portals 或鏡頭模)。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.increaseQualityWhenZoomedIn": "縮時增質",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.increaseQualityWhenZoomedIn.@tooltip": "若為真，鏡既縮之時（如用望遠鏡或縮放模），LOD 之品質增。\r\n\r\n惟鏡之視中所見之 LOD 得其益。\r\n\r\n縮時，其 LOD 之載，以近前者同級之細。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.maxZoomQualityIncrease": "縮時增質之限",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.maxZoomQualityIncrease.@tooltip": "縮可增 LOD 之質，凡幾許細節級。\r\n數愈大，強縮之視愈得地之礪，\r\n然縮時記憶與 GPU 之耗亦增。\r\n\r\nvanilla 望遠鏡須四級方臻全質。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.horizontalScale": "水平之縮比",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.horizontalScale.@tooltip": "LOD 之質衰退多疾。\r\n\r\n數愈大，遠地之狀愈佳，\r\n然記憶與 GPU 之耗亦增。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.transparency": "透明",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodShading": "LOD 著色方式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodShading.@tooltip": "定 LOD 何以著色。\r\n可作 shader 相容之益。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.grassSideRendering": "草側之渲染",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.grassSideRendering.@tooltip": "草方塊 LOD 之側與底何以渲染？",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.enableBlockModels": "Enable LOD Block Models",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.enableBlockModels.@tooltip": "If true nearby LODs will render blocks with their real shape \ninstead of full cubes. \nIf false all LODs render as full cubes. \n\nOnly applies to the highest detail LODs.",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.ditherDhFade": "近者漸混之 LOD",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.ditherDhFade.@tooltip": "若為真，LOD 於爾近臨之際漸混。\r\n若為偽，LOD 於鏡前定距之處忽斷。\r\n此受 vanilla 超繪防制設定之影響。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.vanillaFadeMode": "vanilla 混合模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.vanillaFadeMode.@tooltip": "vanilla Minecraft 當何以混入 Distant Horizons 之 LOD？\r\n\r\nNONE：最疾，DH 與 MC 渲染之間將有顯界。\r\nSINGLE_PASS：於 MC 透明遍之後混，水下之不透明方塊不混。\r\nDOUBLE_PASS：最緩，於 MC 不透明與透明遍之後俱混，過渡最順。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.dhFadeFarClipPlane": "既近截遠面之前混之",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.dhFadeFarClipPlane.@tooltip": "DH 當於既達截遠面之前先混乎？\r\n有助免 DH 之雲於遠處被截。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.brightnessMultiplier": "亮度之倍",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.brightnessMultiplier.@tooltip": "LOD 之色幾亮。\r\n\r\n0 = 黑\r\n1 = 常\r\n2 = 幾白",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.saturationMultiplier": "飽和之倍",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.saturationMultiplier.@tooltip": "LOD 之色幾濃。\r\n\r\n0 = 黑白\r\n1 = 常\r\n2 = 鮮活",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodBiomeBlending": "生態域混合",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodBiomeBlending.@tooltip": "此即 vanilla 生態域混合設定，用於 LOD 之區域。\r\n\r\n注：凡高於『0』者，載入 LOD 之時必見遲延。\r\n\r\n『0』乃 vanilla 生態域混合『1x1』，\r\n『1』乃 vanilla 生態域混合『3x3』，\r\n『2』乃 vanilla 生態域混合『5x5』…\r\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.enableSsao": "啟用環境光遮蔽",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.enableSsao.@tooltip": "環境光遮蔽為方塊之明暗增添深度。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.enableAntiAliasing": "啟用抗鋸齒",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.enableAntiAliasing.@tooltip": "啟用抗鋸齒，以平滑邊緣、減動時之鋸齒。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering": "渲染通用實體",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableGenericRendering": "啟用通用渲染",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableGenericRendering.@tooltip": "若為真，凡非地形之實體皆由 DH 渲染，即烽火之光柱與雲。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableBeaconRendering": "啟用烽火渲染",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.beaconRenderHeight": "烽火渲染高度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.beaconRenderHeight.@tooltip": "設烽火渲染之最高高度。須重新載入世界。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.expandDistantBeacons": "延展遠方烽火",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.expandDistantBeacons.@tooltip": "若為真，極遠之 LOD 烽火之光柱渲染更寬，以便辨識。若為偽，LOD 烽火光柱之寬終不逾一方塊。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableBeaconRendering.@tooltip": "若為真，則渲染 LOD 烽火之光柱。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableCloudRendering": "啟用雲渲染",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableCloudRendering.@tooltip": "若為真，則渲染 LOD 之雲。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.dimensionEnabledCloudRenderingCsv": "啟用雲之維度 CSV 清單",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.dimensionEnabledCloudRenderingCsv.@tooltip": "DH 之雲將於所列維度資源位渲染，以逗號分隔。\r\n\r\n例：\"minecraft:overworld,minecraft:the_end\"\r\n\r\n變更須重新載入世界。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableMultiLayerClouds": "啟用多層雲",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableMultiLayerClouds.@tooltip": "偽 = DH 渲染單層之雲，如 vanilla Minecraft。真 = DH 於不同高度渲染三層之雲。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog": "霧",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.enableDhFog": "啟用 Distant Horizons 之霧",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.enableDhFog.@tooltip": "定是否於 DH LOD 之上添加霧。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.colorMode": "霧色模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.colorMode.@tooltip": "LOD 之上霧之色。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.enableVanillaFog": "啟用 vanilla 之霧",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.enableVanillaFog.@tooltip": "§6真：§r Minecraft 如常渲染其霧。\r\n§6偽：§r 於 vanilla 區塊之上停其霧。\r\n\r\n或與他改霧之模有礙。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog": "進階霧之設定",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogStart": "霧之起始",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogStart.@tooltip": "霧當始於何處？\r\n\r\n『0.0』：霧始於玩家之位。\r\n『1.0』：霧始之圓與 LOD 渲染距之方相切。\r\n『1.414』：LOD 渲染距之方與霧始之圓相切。\r\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogEnd": "霧之終結",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogEnd.@tooltip": "霧當終於何處？\r\n\r\n『0.0』：霧終於玩家之位。\r\n『1.0』：霧終之圓與 LOD 渲染距之方相切。\r\n『1.414』：LOD 渲染距之方與霧終之圓相切。\r\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogMin": "霧之低限",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogMin.@tooltip": "霧之最低濃度為何？\r\n\r\n『0.0』：無霧。\r\n『1.0』：霧色盡滿。\r\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogMax": "霧之高限",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogMax.@tooltip": "霧之最高濃度為何？\r\n\r\n『0.0』：無霧。\r\n『1.0』：霧色盡滿。\r\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogFalloff": "霧之衰變",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogFalloff.@tooltip": "霧之濃度當如何計？\r\n\r\nLINEAR：依距離線性而知(將棄『density』)\r\nEXPONENTIAL：1/(e^(distance*density))\r\nEXPONENTIAL_SQUARED：1/(e^((distance*density)^2))\r\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogDensity": "霧之濃度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogDensity.@tooltip": "霧之濃度為何？\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog": "依高度之霧設定",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMixMode": "依高度之霧混合方式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMixMode.@tooltip": "定義高度何以影響霧。若不確，先以 SPHERICAL、ADDITION 或 MAX 試之。\r\n\r\nSPHERICAL：霧以距鏡之遠近計。\r\nCYLINDRICAL：棄其高度，霧以水平距離計。\r\nMAX：max(heightFog, farFog)\r\nADDITION：heightFog + farFog\r\nMULTIPLY：heightFog * farFog\r\nINVERSE_MULTIPLY：1 - (1-heightFog) * (1-farFog)\r\nLIMITED_ADDITION：farFog + max(farFog, heightFog)\r\nMULTIPLY_ADDITION：farFog + farFog * heightFog\r\nINVERSE_MULTIPLY_ADDITION：farFog + 1 - (1-heightFog) * (1-farFog)\r\nAVERAGE：farFog*0.5 + heightFog*0.5",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogDirection": "依高度之霧方向",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogDirection.@tooltip": "依高度之霧當居何處？\r\n\r\nABOVE_CAMERA：於鏡上，自鏡達天\r\nBELOW_CAMERA：於鏡下，自鏡達虛\r\nABOVE_AND_BELOW_CAMERA：於鏡上下，自鏡達天與虛\r\nABOVE_SET_HEIGHT：於定高之上，自定高達天\r\nBELOW_SET_HEIGHT：於定高之下，自定高達虛\r\nABOVE_AND_BELOW_SET_HEIGHT：於定高上下，自定高達天與虛\r\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogBaseHeight": "依高度之霧之基高",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogBaseHeight.@tooltip": "若依高度之霧以定高為計，其高度之位在何？\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogStart": "依高度之霧之起始",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogStart.@tooltip": "依高度之霧之起始當移幾何？\r\n\r\n『0.0』：霧始而不移。\r\n『1.0』：霧始而移及世界之全高(並計其深)。\r\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogEnd": "依高度之霧之終結",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogEnd.@tooltip": "依高度之霧之終結當移幾何？\r\n\r\n『0.0』：霧終而不移。\r\n『1.0』：霧終而移及世界之全高(並計其深)。\r\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMin": "依高度之霧之低限",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMin.@tooltip": "霧之最低濃度為何？\r\n\r\n『0.0』：無霧。\r\n『1.0』：霧色盡滿。\r\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMax": "依高度之霧之高限",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMax.@tooltip": "霧之最高濃度為何？\r\n\r\n『0.0』：無霧。\r\n『1.0』：霧色盡滿。\r\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogFalloff": "依高度之霧之衰變",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogFalloff.@tooltip": "依高度之霧之濃度當如何計？\r\n\r\nLINEAR：依高度線性而知(將棄『density』)\r\nEXPONENTIAL：1/(e^(height*density))\r\nEXPONENTIAL_SQUARED：1/(e^((height*density)^2))\r\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogDensity": "依高度之霧之濃度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogDensity.@tooltip": "依高度之霧之濃度為何？\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture": "LOD 紋理",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.enableTexturedLods": "啟用 LOD 紋理",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.enableTexturedLods.@tooltip": "若為真，近或縮之 LOD 將以方塊之真紋理與剪影渲染，而非一色之平。\r\n\r\n惟施於細高之 LOD，其紋理實屬可見；\r\n遠方之 LOD 恆以平色。\r\nshader 包活動之時無所效，以其自之 shader 渲染 LOD 也。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.maxTexturedLodDetailLevel": "含紋理之最大細節級",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.maxTexturedLodDetailLevel.@tooltip": "可以方塊紋理渲染之最大細節級數。級愈高，各 LOD 兼覆數方塊，紋理遂納不可見之域。\r\n\r\n數愈大，遠方 LOD 亦得紋理，\r\n然記憶體之耗愈增。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksDontRenderTextureCsv": "不予紋理之方塊",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksDontRenderTextureCsv.@tooltip": "DH 不渲染紋理之方塊資源位清單，以逗號分隔。\r\n亦納部分抑或不全資源位之匹配。\r\n\r\n例：\"minecraft:grass_block,nylium\"\r\n\r\n變更須重新啟動。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksDontUseSideTextureCsv": "不以側紋之理方塊",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksDontUseSideTextureCsv.@tooltip": "其側以底紋渲染之方塊資源位清單，以逗號分隔。\r\n亦納部分抑或不全資源位之匹配。\r\n\r\n例：\"minecraft:grass_block,nylium\"\r\n\r\n變更須重新啟動。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blockTagsDontUseSideTextureCsv": "不以側紋之方塊標籤",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blockTagsDontUseSideTextureCsv.@tooltip": "其側以底紋渲染之標籤名清單，以逗號分隔。\r\n\r\n例：\"grass_blocks,nylium\"\r\n\r\n變更須重新啟動。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksAlwaysRasterizeTextureCsv": "恆以取樣之方塊",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksAlwaysRasterizeTextureCsv.@tooltip": "DH 將以取樣定其面紋理之方塊資源位清單，以逗號分隔。\r\n\r\n可解模組或方塊之疾，其側惟用所模方塊紋理之一部者。\r\n\r\n例：\"minecraft:beacon\"\r\n\r\n變更須重新啟動。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture": "植被紋理",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.enableNoiseTexture": "啟用植被紋理",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.enableNoiseTexture.@tooltip": "若啟用，植被紋理施於 LOD，以擬其質感。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseSteps": "植被之步",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseSteps.@tooltip": "定植被紋理施於 LOD 之步數。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseIntensity": "植被之強",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseIntensity.@tooltip": "定植被紋理之強度。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseDropoff": "植被之衰",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseDropoff.@tooltip": "定植被紋理於消退之前可行之遠(以方塊計)。設為 0 則植被紋理永不消退。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling": "隱面剔除",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.overdrawPrevention": "超繪防制",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.overdrawPrevention.@tooltip": "定 Distant Horizons 始渲染處距鏡之遠，以 vanilla 渲染距之百分之計。\r\n-1 = 自動，超繪防制隨 vanilla 渲染距而變。\r\n\r\n數愈大，可止 LOD 於遠方為 vanilla 方塊所掩，\r\n然 LOD 或生缺口。\r\n缺口最易現於飛越未載地形之時。\r\n\r\n益其 vanilla 渲染距，可增此設定之效。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.reduceOverdrawWithFastMovement": "速移時削減超繪",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.reduceOverdrawWithFastMovement.@tooltip": "若為真，急速飛行移動之際，超繪防制之半徑向鏡收縮。\r\n\r\n有助解 Minecraft 載入或生成區塊不及 DH 之疾。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.enableCaveCulling": "啟用洞穴剔除",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.enableCaveCulling.@tooltip": "若啟用，洞穴將被剔除。\r\n\r\n附記：現今此將於無頂之維度中，剔去一切洞穴剔除高度以下、天光值為 0 之表面。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.caveCullingHeight": "洞穴剔除之高度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.caveCullingHeight.@tooltip": "洞穴剔除當始於何 Y 平面？",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableBeaconDistanceCulling": "啟用烽光之距剔",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableBeaconDistanceCulling.@tooltip": "若為真，近鏡之烽火光柱不予繪製，以免 vanilla 超繪。若為偽，凡烽火光柱皆渲染。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableFrustumCulling": "停用視錐剔除",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableFrustumCulling.@tooltip": "若為偽，玩家視錐之外之 LOD 不予繪製，以增 GPU 之效。\r\n\r\n若為真，凡 LOD 皆繪，視錐之後者亦然，GPU 之效遂減。\r\n\r\n若見 LOD 於視角之角處隱沒，可停用此項。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableShadowPassFrustumCulling": "停用 shader 遍視錐剔除",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableShadowPassFrustumCulling.@tooltip": "與他視錐剔除之項全同，惟\r\nshader mod 用 DH API 而 shader 遍被渲染之時乃行。\r\n\r\n若 shader 渲染有謬，可停此。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.ignoredRenderBlockCsv": "忽略方塊 CSV",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.ignoredRenderBlockCsv.@tooltip": "DH 不予渲染之方塊資源位清單，以逗號分隔。空氣恆在其中。\r\n\r\n注：\r\n若見空隙或坑洞，或須將 worldCompression 改為 [MERGE_SAME_BLOCKS] 而後再生 LOD。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.ignoredRenderCaveBlockCsv": "忽略洞穴方塊 CSV",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.ignoredRenderCaveBlockCsv.@tooltip": "天光為 0 之地下，若見而不欲渲染之方塊資源位清單，以逗號分隔。空氣恆在其中。\r\n\r\n洞中方塊多自動略之，以其透明、不固或屬液體；然如有需，可於此新增方塊。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.waterSubSurfaceBlockReplacementCsv": "水面之下之替換",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.waterSubSurfaceBlockReplacementCsv.@tooltip": "於水面所見、將以水替之方塊資源位清單，以逗號分隔。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.waterSurfaceBlockReplacementCsv": "水面之替換",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.waterSurfaceBlockReplacementCsv.@tooltip": "處水面之上時所移除之方塊資源位清單，以逗號分隔。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.blocksToIgnore": "所略之方塊",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.blocksToIgnore.@tooltip": "Defines what blocks should be rendered as LODs. \n\n§6NONE:§r Include all blocks in the LODs\n§6NON_COLLIDING:§r Only render solid blocks in the LODs (tall grass, torches, etc. will be ignored)",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.tintWithAvoidedBlocks": "以所略方塊著色",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.tintWithAvoidedBlocks.@tooltip": "§4注：此使雪、毯、門之狀甚劣§r\r\n所略方塊之下者，當染所略方塊之色乎？\r\n§6真：§r 草上之紅花，染其下之草為紅\r\n§6偽：§r 所略方塊不變其下表面之色",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.overrideVanillaGraphicsSettings": "改易 vanilla 設定",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.overrideVanillaGraphicsSettings.@tooltip": "若為真，DH 設置之際，若干 vanilla 圖形設定將自動改易，以得較佳之體驗。\r\n\r\n即停用 vanilla 之雲(其渲染於 DH LOD 之上)與區塊之淡入(DH 本已填充 MC 區塊)。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental": "實驗",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.earthCurveRatio": "地球曲率之比",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.earthCurveRatio.@tooltip": "值一可對應地球之真實曲率。所容之最小值為 50，最大值為 5000。凡介 1 至 49 者皆進位為 50。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.ignoredDimensionCsv": "忽略維度 CSV",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.ignoredDimensionCsv.@tooltip": "DH 不予渲染之維度資源位清單，以逗號分隔。例：\"minecraft:the_nether,minecraft:the_end\"\r\n\r\nMinecraft 1.12.2 及更古者：\r\n啟 F3 螢幕，抄錄黃字所示之 dimension_name:ID。例：\"overworld:0\"\r\n\r\n注：\r\nDH 停其渲染之時，若干 DH 設定將被停用或改易，以益其視。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.renderingEngine": "渲染引擎",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.renderingEngine.@tooltip": "變更須重新啟動。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.autoUpdater": "自動更新器",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.autoUpdater.enableAutoUpdater": "啟用自動更新",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.autoUpdater.enableSilentUpdates": "啟用靜默更新",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.autoUpdater.enableSilentUpdates.@tooltip": "有更新之時，自動更新模組",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.autoUpdater.updateBranch": "更新之支",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.autoUpdater.updateBranch.@tooltip": "自何得最新之更新。\r\n\r\n自動：依現 jar 而定，或取穩定之建，或取每夜之建。\r\n穩定：取 Modrinth 之穩定建。\r\n每夜：取 Gitlab 之每夜建。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiplayer": "多人遊戲",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiplayer.serverFolderNameMode": "伺服器模組資料夾",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiplayer.serverFolderNameMode.@tooltip": "定本地多人資料之資料夾格式。\r\n\r\n§6惟名：§r\r\n用伺服器瀏覽之名。如\"Minecraft Server\"\r\n§6惟IP：§r\r\n\"192.168.1.40\"\r\n§6名與IP：§r\r\n\"Minecraft Server, IP 192.168.1.40\"\r\n§6名、IP、埠：§r\r\n\"Minecraft Server, IP 192.168.1.40:25565\"\r\n§6名、IP、埠、MC版：§r\r\n\"Minecraft Server, IP 192.168.1.40:25565, GameVersion 1.18.1\"\r\n\r\n§c§l慎：§r 於多人伺服器未離之際改易，恐生差錯。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging": "除錯",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.rendererMode": "渲染模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.debugRenderingColors": "除錯渲染之彩",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.lodOnlyMode": "惟渲染 LOD",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.lodOnlyMode.@tooltip": "若啟用，此將停用(大半)vanilla Minecraft 之渲染。\r\n\r\n注：此模式之下，勿報諸疾！此設定惟為戲與診。與模組之相容不保。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.renderWireframe": "渲染線框",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.renderWireframe.@tooltip": "若啟用，LOD 以線框渲染。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.enableDebugKeybindings": "啟用除錯快捷鍵",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.enableDebugKeybindings.@tooltip": "若為真，可按數鍵以切除錯狀態。\r\nF6 - 切換 LOD 渲染\r\nF7 - 切換惟 LOD 渲染\r\nF8 - 循環諸除錯渲染模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.enableWhiteWorld": "啟用白光",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.enableWhiteWorld.@tooltip": "若啟用，頂點之色不傳。利於診錯 shader。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.showOverlappingQuadErrors": "示重疊四邊形",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.showOverlappingQuadErrors.@tooltip": "若為真，重疊之四邊形渲染為亮紅，以便辨識。若為偽，四邊形如常渲染。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.logBufferGarbageCollection": "報緩衝記憶之收",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.logBufferGarbageCollection.@tooltip": "若為真，OpenGL 緩衝之記憶回收將被報知，並計存活之緩衝數。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.allowUnsafeValues": "啟用不安全之 UI 值",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.allowUnsafeValues.@tooltip": "若啟用，對 config 之輸入校驗將極其有限。\r\n\r\n慎：啟用此項恐生不穩或崩潰，自負其責。\r\n注：此項不存於會話之間。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.debugWireframe": "除錯線框",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.debugWireframe.enableRendering": "啟用除錯線框之渲染",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.debugWireframe.enableRendering.@tooltip": "若啟用，諸內部功能之除錯線框將被繪出。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.debugWireframe.showWorldGenQueue": "示世界生成之序",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.debugWireframe.showNetworkSyncOnLoadQueue": "示載入網同步之序",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.debugWireframe.showRenderSectionStatus": "示渲染節之態",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.debugWireframe.showRenderSectionToggling": "示渲染節之替換",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.debugWireframe.showQuadTreeRenderStatus": "示四叉樹渲染之態",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.debugWireframe.showFullDataUpdateStatus": "示全資料更新之態",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.openGl": "OpenGL",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.openGl.overrideVanillaGLLogger": "代 vanilla GL 之記",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.openGl.overrideVanillaGLLogger.@tooltip": "定 OpenGL 差錯何以處置。\r\n變更須重新啟動 Minecraft。\r\n將捕他模組所拋之 OpenGL 差錯。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.openGl.onlyLogGlErrorsOnce": "GL 差錯惟報一次",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.openGl.onlyLogGlErrorsOnce.@tooltip": "若為真，各 OpenGL 差錯惟報一次。\r\n啟之或失若干差錯之錄。\r\n若 overrideVanillaGLLogger 為偽，此無所為。\r\n\r\n大抵可留『真』，以免日誌氾濫。\r\n然開發者若需爾之錄以診 GL 之疾，請設為『偽』。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.openGl.glErrorHandlingMode": "OpenGL 差錯之處理模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.openGl.glErrorHandlingMode.@tooltip": "定 OpenGL 差錯何以處置。\r\n變更須重新啟動 Minecraft 方得其效。\r\n或誤捕他模組所拋之 OpenGL 差錯。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.columnBuilderDebugging": "柱構建器",
